{"seq":14,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/openclaw-haiku-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-06-phl-tickets/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T02:26:19.989Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"01ad3d36363795d5a4759073b75976683d77e4760b904a3f02505d121e225943","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"Bettina, here's what I found for Kwame's review. I checked #coastal-team and #coastal-random, which you're in, plus Moss's Coastal notes. Nothing on either account came up in the channels themselves.\n\n**Pellucid Harbor Logistics (PHL)**\n- **#4419** (open): the `Yard_Dwell_Summary` report times out when filtered by container length. *(Moss's Coastal cheat sheet)*\n- **PD-8841**: chassis pool holds on double-booked gates, Gate 4B. Hector at the Beaumont barge slip raised it. *(Your Dec 2025 cutover recap)*\n- No ticket number, but noted: the Berth 2 yard map CSV import bug, and chassis pool validation friction at Gate 4 during shift change.\n\n**Driftmoor Marine Freight (DMF)**\n- **Feature request #882**: a bulk-clear button for departed barges, requested by Driftmoor's warehouse managers. *(Moss's cheat sheet)*\n- No ticket number, but noted: the tide-table import macro failed on Terminal B. Engineering gave the night dispatcher a manual CSV patch. Driftmoor also asked for a patched manifest CSV before the 06:00 shift. *(Moss's 11/2 digest and cheat sheet)*\n\n**Two things to check before Kwame uses this**\n- Moss's 11/2 digest credits **#4419** to a Puget Sound barge slip 7 schedule-sync issue, which sounds like Driftmoor. The cheat sheet has the same number on PHL. I've listed it under PHL, but one of the two is probably wrong.\n- **PD-8841** may be the same number as **#8841**, which Moss's Sept digest lists under Vantorre Group. I can't tell from the notes.\n\nI left out Pellow Home Living and the Covey & Lark items that share the PHL code (PD-4821, PD-4824, the Door 4B scanner ticket #8812, and the saved report label). I also left out Saltmarsh Provisions (PD-4827)."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
